{"id":"okolo","lemma":"около","pos":"prep","rank":382,"glosses":["near, around, about, by"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5a/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я около станции.","en":"I'm near the station.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"station","l":"станция"}]},{"text":"Он пришел около двух.","en":"He came about two.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,null,{"g":"two","l":"два"}]},{"text":"Я был здесь около года назад.","en":"I was here about a year ago.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"here"},null,{"g":"year","l":"год"},{"g":"back"}]},{"text":"Тебе придётся подождать там около часа.","en":"You'll have to wait there about an hour.","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},null,{"g":"to wait"},{"g":"there"},null,{"g":"hour","l":"час"}]},{"text":"Том живёт около нас.","en":"Tom lives near us.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to live","l":"жить"},null,{"g":"us","l":"мы"}]}]}